{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Galactic Prospectors</strong></i> is a 2D Space Survival Sandbox set 200 years in the future when all planets in the solar system were destroyed by you, a rogue AI. Take on the universe against humans and other life forms, all while trying to stay alive. Even as an AI, you too must survive the harsh elements of Space. Resources are still needed, requiring you to build factories, upgrade and maintain your ships and stations, and to live. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Galactic Prospectors</strong></i>\u00a0will have the following features upon release into Early Access:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> <i>Explore the vastness of Space. Travel to new sectors. Upgrade ships, build space stations, conquer enemies. It's an infinite world!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Craft:</strong> <i>Build space stations, ships, and other things. Craft components from resources such as ores mined from Asteroids that have been refined into Ingots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat:</strong> <i>Survive in this world against humans, other rogue AI, aliens and more. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Durability &amp; Health:</strong> <i>All ships and stations have health. This means, bullets deal damage, colliding with space junk deals damage. Repair your ships and stations using components and resources.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currency &amp; Shop System:</strong> <i>Buy ships, special weapons and tools, and more.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Your purchase entitles you to receive all future updates free of charge!</strong></u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561380?t=1772602343","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561380/2183905c6e1087e71a7e2b45505ea357454ff459/page_bg